{"id":"n1-050","title":"Noun なしには～ない","romaji":"Noun nashi ni wa ~nai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'without', 'cannot do without', 'not possible without'.","longExplanation":"The なしには～ない grammar point is used to express that without the mentioned noun, something is not possible. It can be translated as 'cannot (do) without ~', or 'not possible without ~'.","formation":"Noun + なしには + Verb-negative","examples":[{"jp":"お金なしには生活ができない。","romaji":"Okane nashi ni wa seikatsu ga dekinai.","en":"I cannot get by without money.","words":[{"surface":"お金","vocabId":"1001820","reading":"おかね"},{"surface":"なし","vocabId":"1529560","reading":"なし","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"生活","vocabId":"1378860","reading":"せいかつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"愛情なしには子育てができない。","romaji":"Aijou nashi ni wa kosodate ga dekinai.","en":"You cannot raise a child without love.","words":[{"surface":"愛情","vocabId":"1150860","reading":"あいじょう"},{"surface":"なし","vocabId":"1529560","reading":"なし","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"子育て","vocabId":"1307790","reading":"こそだて"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"彼なしにはこのプロジェクトを進められない。","romaji":"Kare nashi ni wa kono purojekuto o susumerarenai.","en":"Without him, I cannot move this project forward.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"なし","vocabId":"1529560","reading":"なし","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進め","vocabId"